summary:
  The cut has no ceiling.

history:
  The largest cut the survey called for was 10.2 dB. A reading that asks for
  more than 15 is more likely a fault in the reading than a station, and
  without the ceiling one bad number makes a station inaudible for a month.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
      return Math.max(-MAX_CUT_DB, Math.min(0, TARGET_LUFS - lufs));

replace:
      return Math.min(0, TARGET_LUFS - lufs);

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_no_reading_turns_a_station_down_more_than_fifteen.
  Line-neutral.
